Package: dilemma
Type: Package
Title: Prisoner's Dilemma Games on Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Mohamed Hsin", "Bennour",
      email = "your@email",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Simulates the prisoner's dilemma among players connected by a
    network. In each round, players play the game with each of their peers,
    score their payoffs, and copy the best-performing peer when their peers
    did better. Any 'igraph' or 'tidygraph' network can be used, and players
    can judge success by the sum, mean or median of their payoffs, or by
    comparing with a single random peer.
